### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### List borrowing requests (with optional status filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/borrowing-requests
Accept: application/json

### Filter by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/borrowing-requests?status=diajukan
Accept: application/json

### Get pending requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/borrowing-requests?status=diajukan&per_page=10
Accept: application/json

### Create borrowing request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/borrowing-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "requested_by": 1,
  "purpose": "Pengujian rutin bahan kimia untuk analisis sampel air",
  "items": [
    {
      "item_id": 1,
      "item_unit_id": null,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Approve borrowing request
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/borrowing-requests/1/approve
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "approved_by": 1,
  "notes": "Disetujui untuk keperluan pengujian"
}

### Reject borrowing request
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/borrowing-requests/1/reject
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "rejected_by": 1,
  "rejection_reason": "Bahan yang diminta tergolong berbahaya, perlunya izin tambahan"
}

### Cancel borrowing request
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/borrowing-requests/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "cancelled_by": 1,
  "cancellation_reason": "Permintaan tidak diperlukan lagi"
}

### Complete borrowing (after return)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/borrowing-requests/1/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "completed_by": 1,
  "notes": "Semua barang dikembalikan"
}

### Get single borrowing request with items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/borrowing-requests/1
Accept: application/json